{"name":"Crowberry","hex":"#220055","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"crowberry","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Empetrum; a small genus of dwarf evergreen shrubs that bear edible fruit.","Empetrum nigrum; a species of crowberry."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/crowberry"}],"entries":[{"title":"Empetrum nigrum","blocks":[{"text":"Empetrum nigrum, the crowberry, black crowberry, mossberry, rockberry, or, in western Alaska, Labrador, etc., blackberry, is a flowering plant species in the heather family Ericaceae with a near circumboreal distribution in the Northern Hemisphere. North American Indigenous names for this species include asiavik (Iñupiaq), dineechʼúh (Gwichʼin), paurngaq (Inuktut), xéelʼi (Tlingít), xa skáawaa (Haida), and ts'nełt'ida (Dena’ina)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Empetrum_nigrum_by_Maseltov_2.jpg/330px-Empetrum_nigrum_by_Maseltov_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Empetrum_nigrum","wikidata":"Q202305"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Empetrum.jpg/500px-Empetrum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Empetrum.jpg/960px-Empetrum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Empetrum.jpg/500px-Empetrum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEmpetrum.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Vaccinium_vitis-idaea_and_Empetrum_nigrum_20230823.jpg/500px-Vaccinium_vitis-idaea_and_Empetrum_nigrum_20230823.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thu